/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E ("In every high-stakes crisis involving a child, there is someone just out of frame absorbing the chaos, holding the pieces, and often breaking in silence.")
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E (ACEs \(Adverse Childhood Experiences\) transformed how we understand childhood trauma. But caregivers have been left without a parallel lens. TRACEs fills that gap. When caregivers collapse, systems collapse. If we don't name caregiver trauma, we can't screen for it, support it, or treat it.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
